<title>USA: Accustaff acquires U.K. staffing firm.</title>
<headline>Accustaff acquires U.K. staffing firm.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>AccuStaff Inc said on Tuesday it had acquired Badenoch &amp; Clark Ltd, one of Britain's leading temporary professional services provider.</p>
<p>The transaction, which marks the company's entry into the British market, is expected to be accretive to earnings per share, AccuStaff said.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Badenoch &amp; Clark had revenues in excess of $40 million for calendar year 1996 and is estimated to reach $50 million over the next twelve months, AccuStaff said.</p>
